  cardTitle:'Accordion Flashcard — the Squeeze-and-Sing Instrument | Ages 3–5',
  intro:'A red accordion with rainbow bellows — the instrument that sings by breathing. Squeeze it shut and the air rushes out through reeds, which makes this the noisiest hug in the whole Music Room.',
  say:'Squeeze it out, push it in — eee-ahh, eee-ahh! The accordion sings when it breathes, just like you do.',
