  cardTitle:'Castanets Flashcard — the Clicking Shell Clap | Ages 3–5',
  intro:'Castanets — two little shells that click together in your hand. They are pocket-sized, they are fast, and they turn any hand into the tiniest drum kit in the Music Room.',
